  "description": "<p>KnifeSprint gives you a small sprint speed boost whenever your melee weapon is out. Default is a subtle 15% enough to feel snappier without being broken. Fully configurable in BepInEx if you want more or less.</p>\n<p>Switching back to your gun mid-sprint? Boost drops instantly, so no you cant cheese, or can you? :D</p>\n<p>Config: Sprint Speed Multiplier default 1.15, range 1.0–2.0</p>\n<h1>All settings are available in the F12 BepInEx menu in-game.</h1>\n",
